WEBVTT

00:00.180 --> 00:05.240
To ensure a screen reader will be able to
read this document correctly we must set

00:05.240 --> 00:14.040
the correct language. So under the review
menu under language select language and

00:14.040 --> 00:21.020
then there's proofing language and in this
case we actually want it to be English

00:21.020 --> 00:25.160
United States and then we set it and we're
done.

